ated within the National Capital Region (NCR) of India, IIM Rohtak is 90 minutes from Delhi International Airport.<\/li>\n<li>The state-of-the-art campus spread over an area of 200 acres is strategically located on National Highway - 10 and is well connected to Delhi.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Significance of IIM Rohtak's Logo<\/strong>:\n<ul>\n<li>Peacock represents the exuberance and pride in IIM Rohtak&rsquo;s vision to be a global leader, while the Sanskrit words which read &lsquo;Management through knowledge and values&rsquo; signify IIM Rohtak&rsquo;s mission of knowledge diffusion, social commitment and value system (or corporate governance).<\/li>\n<li>Green circle represents the nature and environment that is fundamental to society&rsquo;s progress and human happiness, whereas the red circle represents the vibrancy of the youth that energizes education and sustains the progress of society.<\/li>\n<li>The white color in the logo represents the underlying sense of purpose and the goal of social progress, while the open book signifies knowledge creation and dissemination.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>","public_url":"c\/indian-institute-of-management-iim-rohtak-placement-interview-competitions-articles-videos-592","logoUrl":"https:\/\/d8it4huxumps7.cloudfront.net\/images\/partners\/partners75\/5d08e336c6a1e_Indian_Institute_of_Management_Rohtak_logo.jpg","logoUrl2":"https:\/\/d8it4huxumps7.cloudfront.net\/images\/partners\/partners125\/5d08e336c6a1e_Indian_Institute_of_Management_Rohtak_logo.jpg","organisation_type":"2","wp_tag":580,"seo_url":"https:\/\/unstop.com\/c\/indian-institute-of-management-iim-rohtak-placement-interview-competitions-articles-videos-592","website":"https:\/\/www.iimrohtak.ac.in\/","extra_fields":"{\"industry\":\"\",\"founder\":\"\",\"foundedOn\":\"\",\"keyPeople\":\"\",\"headquarter\":\"\",\"founderUrl\":\"\"}"},"rounds":[{"id":1637344,"opportunity_id":1765708,"entity_id":868141,"entity_type":"App\\Model\\Rounds","is_inactive":0,"is_hidden":0,